---
title: "parse_and_verify_accumulator_message (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_header: header = deserialize_u32(cursor)
    q_header --> q_check_magic: header == PYTHNET_ACCUMULATOR_UPDATE_MAGIC
    q_check_magic --> q_abort_hdr: false, abort E_INVALID_ACCUMULATOR_HEADER
    q_check_magic --> q_major: true
    q_major --> q_check_major: major = deserialize_u8(cursor)
    q_check_major --> q_abort_major: major != MAJOR_VERSION, abort E_INVALID_ACCUMULATOR_PAYLOAD
    q_check_major --> q_minor: major == MAJOR_VERSION
    q_minor --> q_check_minor: minor = deserialize_u8(cursor)
    q_check_minor --> q_abort_minor: minor < MINIMUM_SUPPORTED_MINOR_VERSION, abort
    q_check_minor --> q_trailing: minor >= MINIMUM_SUPPORTED_MINOR_VERSION
    q_trailing --> q_skip_trailing: skip trailing_size bytes
    q_skip_trailing --> q_proof_type: proof_type = deserialize_u8(cursor)
    q_proof_type --> q_abort_proof: proof_type != 0, abort
    q_proof_type --> q_skip_vaa: proof_type == 0
    q_skip_vaa --> q_parse_root: skip vaa_size bytes (already verified externally)
    q_parse_root --> q_merkle: merkle_root = parse_merkle_root_from_vaa_payload(vaa_payload)
    q_merkle --> [*]: return parse_and_verify_accumulator_updates(cursor, merkle_root, clock)

    note right of q_check_magic
        INV-001: magic must be PYTHNET_ACCUMULATOR_UPDATE_MAGIC (1347305813)
        INV-002: major version must match MAJOR_VERSION (1)
        INV-003: minor version must be >= MINIMUM_SUPPORTED_MINOR_VERSION (0)
        INV-004: proof_type must be 0 (Merkle)
        INV-005: VAA inside accumulator is skipped (already verified by caller)
    end note
